                <property name="valign">start</property>
                <property name="label" translatable="yes">The time and date of the displayed weather information can be adjusted using the slider on the bottom left hand side of the screen. Upon opening the application, the date and time is set to the date and time that the application was opened. By moving the slider to the right, future times and dates can be selected with an upper bound of 7 days from the time the application was opened. You cannot select past dates and times.
</property>
